<% content_for :title, 'Your information' %><section class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THOUGHTFULLY HANDLED</span><h1>Your information.<br><em>Your confidence.</em></h1></section><article class="section prose narrow"><h2>About this local preview</h2><p>This development version of Ora stores information in a local SQLite database. It is a demonstration of the proposed care experience. Do not enter real medical records, identity numbers, or sensitive financial documents.</p><h3>What the app stores</h3><p>Your name, phone number, email, saved procedures, care requests and the affordability information you choose to provide. Authorised operations users can review care records and support messages.</p><h3>How it is used</h3><p>Information entered here supports the care journey you request. No SMS messages, credit bureau checks, lender applications, payments, or clinic notifications are sent by this preview.</p><h3>Your choices</h3><p>You can explore procedures without an account. Financing is optional. Contact Ora through the support form to request a correction or removal of your records.</p><h3>Before launch</h3><p>A live privacy notice, retention policy, partner agreements and appropriate data controls must be established before Ora collects real patient information. This page describes the current prototype and is not a substitute for that launch policy.</p><%= link_to 'Contact Ora ↗', support_path, class: 'text-link' %></article>
